/addons/dot_player_controller
/addons/dot_player_char
/addons/dot_player_class
/addons/dot_team
# zee-dot-weapons, the weapons pack: gamemann's rather than modcommunity's, resolved by
# dot-ci and bootstrap.sh from this line like every addon above. Its art is NOT here --
# it is vendored under assets/, because a delivered pack has to carry it.
/addons/zee_weapons
